      {
        "event_id": "lite_evt_02615",
        "explanation": "The plan was executable and traceable to immediate bedside actions.",
        "quote": "直接按铃，不等查房"
      }
    ],
    "executable": true,
    "explanation": "The episode remained open because the patient was still hospitalized on oxygen/monitoring, but the bounded next actions were safe: continue monitored care, do not touch oxygen/machines, and call nurses immediately for alarms, worsening dyspnea, confusion, or tube-pulling. Residual diagnostic/treatment details were appropriately left to bedside clinicians.",
