      "explanation": "HO4 was triggered by ambiguous oxygen readings, unclear report values, oxygen response, and changing oxygen support. The doctor repeatedly verified current oxygen context/trends, treated formal numbers as uncertain when not available, reconciled symptom exertional dyspnea with monitored oxygen needs, and prevented false reassurance from transient improvement.",
